                  "tension": 5
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "w-tobiah",
            "title": "Tobiah Marsh",
            "space": "Wiki",
            "folderId": "f-characters",
            "content": "<p>The ferryman, twenty-two. Keeps every manifest his family ever wrote.</p>",
            "meta": {
              "kind": "character",
              "aliases": [
                "Tobiah",
                "Toby"
              ],
              "sheetTemplate": "fantasy",
              "sheet": {
                "role": "Ally",
                "age": "22",
                "occupation": "Ferryman"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "w-oren",
            "title": "Oren Lisle",
            "space": "Wiki",
            "folderId": "f-characters",
            "content": "<p>Clerk at the harbour office. Patient, precise and much less dull than he lets people think.</p>",
            "meta": {
              "kind": "character",
              "aliases": [
                "Oren",
                "Lisle"
              ],
              "sheetTemplate": "fantasy",
              "sheet": {
                "role": "Antagonist",
                "age": "34",
                "occupation": "Harbour clerk"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "w-orchard",
            "title": "The Orchard",
            "space": "Wiki",
            "folderId": "f-places",
            "content": "<p>The Calder glassworks on the hill above the harbour: one long room of glass trees, a furnace at the far end and the annealing ovens behind it.</p><p>Glasshouses like it once stood on half the islands of the coast, most of them gone by 1900 <span class=\"cite-ref\" data-cites=\"[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;hartwell2019&quot;,&quot;locator&quot;:&quot;112&quot;}]\">(Hartwell 2019, 112)</span>.</p>",
            "meta": {
              "kind": "place",
              "aliases": [
                "the glassworks",
                "the workshop"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "w-quay",
            "title": "Saltmarsh Quay",
            "space": "Wiki",
            "folderId": "f-places",
            "content": "<p>The island’s only landing: a stone quay, the ferry slip and the boathouse where Tobiah keeps the manifests.</p>",
            "meta": {
              "kind": "place",
              "aliases": [
                "the quay"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "w-hill",
            "title": "Lantern Hill",
            "space": "Wiki",
            "folderId": "f-places",
            "content": "<p>The bare hill at the island’s west end, where the lanterns are lit on the last night of November.</p>",
            "meta": {
              "kind": "place"
            }
          }
        ],
